<title>DENMARK: Municipality Finance issues 150 mln Dkk bond.</title>
<headline>Municipality Finance issues 150 mln Dkk bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Wednesday by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - MUNICIPALITY FINANCE LTD, HELSINKI, FINLAND</p>
<p>AMT - 150 MILLION DANISH CROWNS</p>
<p>COUPON - FOUR PERCENT</p>
<p>MATURITY 15 MARCH 2000</p>
<p>TO BE LISTED ON COPENHAGEN STOCK EXCHANGE 16 DECEMBER 1996.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
